 </div> <div class="col-lg-7 col-md-12"> <div class="trv-faq-right-section m-b30"> <div class="wt-accordion" id="faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h0"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class="" data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c0"> 01 - How do I book a tour with 4Guys Travel & Tourism? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c0" class="collapse show " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h0" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> Simply browse our tours, choose your preferred destination and dates, then complete the booking online in a few easy steps. You will receive an instant confirmation email with all the details of your trip. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h1"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c1"> 02 - Can I customise an existing tour package? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c1" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h1" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> Absolutely! Many of our tours can be tailored to your interests, pace and budget. Contact our travel team and we will craft a personalised itinerary just for you. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h2"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c2"> 03 - What is included in the tour price? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c2" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h2" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> Each tour clearly lists what is included, typically accommodation, guided activities, selected meals and local transfers. Flights and personal expenses are usually not included unless stated otherwise. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h3"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c3"> 04 - What payment methods do you accept? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c3" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h3" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> We accept all major credit and debit cards, bank transfers and secure online payments. A deposit is required to confirm your booking, with the balance due before departure. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h4"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c4"> 05 - What is your cancellation and refund policy? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c4" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h4" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> Cancellation terms vary by tour. In most cases, cancellations made well in advance are eligible for a partial or full refund. Please review the specific terms for your booking or contact our support team for assistance. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h5"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c5"> 06 - Do I need travel insurance? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c5" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h5" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> We strongly recommend comprehensive travel insurance for every trip. It protects you against unexpected events such as trip cancellation, medical emergencies and lost luggage. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h6"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c6"> 07 - Are your tours suitable for solo travellers? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c6" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h6" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> Yes! Many of our travellers join solo. Group tours are a great way to meet like-minded people, and our guides ensure everyone feels welcome and included throughout the journey. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" id="faq6aa92558eba87-h7"> <h4 class="acod-title"> <a class=" collapsed " data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#faq6aa92558eba87-c7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq6aa92558eba87-c7"> 08 - What should I pack for my trip? <span class="indicator"><i class="bi bi-chevron-right"></i></span> </a> </h4> </div> <div id="faq6aa92558eba87-c7" class="collapse " aria-labelledby="faq6aa92558eba87-h7" data-bs-parent="#faq6aa92558eba87"> <div class="acod-content"> After booking, we provide a detailed packing list tailored to your destination and the season. As a rule, pack light, bring comfortable footwear and don't forget travel documents and any required medication. </div> </div> </div> <div class="panel wt-panel"> <div class="acod-head" 